# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LeadHunter — Environment Variables
#
# None of these are required. The app is fully functional with no configuration
# at all: business data comes from OpenStreetMap and website quality is measured
# by the built-in audit engine, neither of which needs a key or a billing account.
#
# Copy this to .env.local only if you want the optional enrichment below.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Foursquare Places API key (OPTIONAL)
#
# When set, Foursquare is queried only where OpenStreetMap returns fewer than
# five results, and only to fill gaps. It contributes ratings and review counts,
# which OpenStreetMap does not carry.
#
# Leave it unset and the app stays entirely keyless.
# Free tier, no credit card: https://foursquare.com/developers/
# FOURSQUARE_API_KEY=
